  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 189d3e3b081dcc84aa2f60926508fda9, type: 3}
  m_Name: Hanba
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  nameEnglish: Hanba, The Eternal
  descriptionEnglish: "Hanba has died so many times that it's as if heaven and hell
    are playing a game of tennis with him, and neither of them wants to accept him.
    Forced to remain on Earth, he can't stand dying anymore and always says that
    if he dies again, he'll quit this exorcist life and let Azaus figure it out on
    his own. \n\nHe doesn't have much going on in his head, which makes conversations
    with him a true test of boredom resistance. And don't use irony with him. He
    just doesn't get it. But other than that, he's a good guy."
  nameChinese: "\u97E9\u5DF4\uFF0C\u6C38\u6052\u4E4B\u4EBA"
  descriptionChinese: "\u97E9\u5DF4\u5DF2\u7ECF\u6B7B\u8FC7\u90A3\u4E48\u591A\u6B21\uFF0C\u5C31\u597D\u50CF\u5929\u5802\u548C\u5730\u72F1\u5728\u7528\u4ED6\u6253\u4E00\u573A\u7F51\u7403\u6BD4\u8D5B\uFF0C\u4F46\u4E24\u8005\u90FD\u4E0D\u613F\u610F\u63A5\u7EB3\u4ED6\u3002\u4ED6\u88AB\u8FEB\u7559\u5728\u5730\u7403\u4E0A\uFF0C\u4ED6\u518D\u4E5F\u53D7\u4E0D\u4E86\u6B7B\u4EA1\uFF0C\u5E76\u4E14\u603B\u662F\u8BF4\u5982\u679C\u4ED6\u53C8\u6B7B\u4E00\u6B21\u7684\u8BDD\uFF0C\u4ED6\u5C31\u4F1A\u653E\u5F03\u8FD9\u4E2A\u6076\u9B54\u730E\u4EBA\u7684\u751F\u6D3B\uFF0C\u8BA9\u963F\u624E\u65AF\u81EA\u5DF1\u89E3\u51B3\u3002\n\n\u4ED6\u7684\u5934\u8111\u7A7A\u7A7A\u7684\uFF0C\u6CA1\u88C5\u4EC0\u4E48\u4E8B\u60C5\u3002\u6240\u4EE5\u548C\u4ED6\u804A\u5929\uFF0C\u662F\u4E00\u573A\u68C0\u9A8C\u4EBA\u80FD\u5426\u62B5\u6297\u6781\u7AEF\u65E0\u804A\u7684\u8003\u9A8C\u3002\u8FD8\u6709\uFF0C\u6CA1\u5FC5\u8981\u5632\u8BBD\u4ED6\u3002\u4ED6\u5C31\u662F\u641E\u4E0D\u660E\u767D\u5F88\u591A\u4E8B\u3002\u4E0D\u8FC7\u561B\uFF0C\u4ED6\u662F\u4E2A\u597D\u4EBA\u3002"
  namePortuguese: Hanba, O Eterno
  descriptionPortuguese: "Hanba j\xE1 morreu tantas vezes que parece que o c\xE9u
    e o inferno est\xE3o jogando t\xEAnis com ele \u2014 e nenhum dos dois quer aceit\xE1-lo.
    For\xE7ado a permanecer na Terra, ele n\xE3o aguenta mais morrer e vive dizendo
    que, se morrer de novo, vai largar essa vida de exorcista e deixar o Azaus se
    virar sozinho.\n\nEle n\xE3o tem muita coisa acontecendo dentro da cabe\xE7a,
    o que faz qualquer conversa com ele ser um verdadeiro teste de resist\xEAncia
    ao t\xE9dio. E nem pense em usar ironia com ele. Ele simplesmente n\xE3o entende.\nMas
    fora isso, \xE9 um cara gente boa."
  nameSpanish: Hanba, El Eterno
  weaponDescriptionSpanish: "Hanba ha muerto tantas veces que parece como si el cielo
    y el infierno estuvieran jugando al tenis con \xE9l, y ninguno de los dos quiere
    aceptarlo. Obligado a permanecer en la Tierra, ya no soporta morir y siempre
    dice que si muere de nuevo, abandonar\xE1 esta vida de exorcista y dejar\xE1
    que Azaus se las arregle solo. No tiene mucho en la cabeza, lo que hace que las
    conversaciones con \xE9l sean una verdadera prueba de resistencia al aburrimiento.
    Y no uses iron\xEDa con \xE9l. Simplemente no lo entiende. Pero aparte de eso,
    es un buen tipo."
  shortName: Hanba
  smallIcon: {fileID: -155200894, guid: bf798d7d3335643418da4618d499420c, type: 3}
